s that change with every world.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00a0</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\u00a0</h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3214530/extras/c794cb9067b3431b90ac427bcf1703ad.webp?t=1745257270\" width=576 height=41 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3214530/extras/84632988d4028a88e1fced787da6e80e.poster.avif?t=1745257270\" width=480 height=454 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3214530/extras/84632988d4028a88e1fced787da6e80e.webm?t=1745257270\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3214530/extras/84632988d4028a88e1fced787da6e80e.mp4?t=1745257270\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every journey deserves a reward.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Collect a variety of unexpected treasures.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Can you gather them all?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3214530/extras/03b9f250990b9233af1d8b19a1776056.webp?t=1745257270\" width=576 height=41 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3214530/extras/b2ed8d28a2ac9f27f41f6ef67d67a5b4.poster.avif?t=1745257270\" width=480 height=360 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3214530/extras/b2ed8d28a2ac9f27f41f6ef67d67a5b